        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka abantu baayanga kuhurira ebi Samueli yaabagambira, baagira bati: Ngaaha; kureka nitwenda ngu tutegyekwe omugabe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
