        {
          "text": " MUKAMA yaagira Samueli ati: Hurira eki barikugamba, obateereho omugabe. Bwanyima Samueli yaagira abashaija ba Israeli ati: Mwirooko mugarukyeyo, buri muntu omu rurembo rw'owaabo.",
